// Caster leveling RW bases — Stealth (+ Lore via leveling_rw_lore.nip).
// Loaded from AutoGear.js for sorc + caster necro (not poisonstrike / melee).
// Lore: leveling_rw_lore.nip (also used by poisonstrike). Fire Leaf / Spirit: separate nips.
// MiniShop: Runewords.wantStealthShopBase / wantLoreShopBase.

// Stealth (Tal+Eth) — Breast Plate / Light Plate only (light armor, good def, low str)
([Name] == BreastPlate || [Name] == LightPlate) && [Flag] != Ethereal && [quality] <= superior # [Sockets] == 2
